    "story": "## Purpose\n\nRead-only national voter roll (~29M rows). Search with pagination only — never full grid load.\n\n## Scenarios\n\n- **S7** — search + link from call-center wizard (**S2** step 2).\n- **S2** — mandatory link for approved members; temporary area link type.\n\n## Rules\n\n- PK = legacy PerId.\n- `member_id` back-link when linked; geo titles from Geographic Divisions.",
